Changes made in this repository
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Changes relative to gkintu/hf-speech-to-speech:

- Added scripts/run_mac.py, a launcher for Apple Silicon Macs.
- Removed the camera tool from the browser demo, and changed the header credit,
  links, and About panel. Files changed: demo/CONTEXT.md, demo/README.md,
  demo/index.html, demo/main.js, demo/style.css, demo/ui/chat.js,
  demo/rtc/s2s-rtc-client.js, demo/ws/s2s-ws-client.js.
- Rewrote README.md, and added this NOTICE file and media/voice-agent-ui.png.
- Updated the authors, URLs, and license files in pyproject.toml.
- Removed logo.png and the Docker files (Dockerfile, Dockerfile.arm64,
  docker-compose.yml, .dockerignore, demo/Dockerfile, demo/.dockerignore),
  along with the Docker and Hugging Face Space setup in demo/README.md.
- Removed unused upstream files: archive/, examples/, docs/assets/, the
  star-history chart with its workflow and script, and
  media/local-realtime-voice-agent.png.
- Removed references to archive/ from scripts/benchmark_stt.py and
  src/speech_to_speech/TTS/README.md.

